          "enonce": "Calculer I = ∫₀²(3x² + 2) dx.",
          "difficulte": "facile",
          "etapesCorrection": [
            "Une primitive de 3x² + 2 est F(x)=x³+2x.",
            "I=F(2)−F(0).",
            "I=(8+4)−0=12."
